        "title": "Confronting",
        "text": "For the westerner, this is such a complex mix of values that we may find very confronting.\nSuch as…\n- The public display of family grief with onlookers and tourists looking on.\n- Kids frolicking in the river right next to a ritual body preparation.\n- The expectation that tourists will take pics of a cremation (See rule 6)\n- trinket selling vendors pleading for a sale\n\nJust a few observations. Maybe we get it wrong? 🤷‍♂️",
